        {
            "title": "富瑞調高莎莎國際目標價至1.81元   維持「買入」評級",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">富瑞發表最新研報指出，莎莎國際(00178)2027財年上半財年業績勝預期，純利表現較早前發出的盈喜公告高出13%。該行上調其2027至2029財年盈利預測29%至34%，並將目標價由1.4港元調高29%至1.81港元，重申「買入」評級，繼續視其為香港零售板塊首選。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"莎莎門店\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/10/20241003_FI_source-bp_00178.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"莎莎門店\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/10/20241003_FI_source-bp_00178.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">莎莎門店</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">期內，集團宣派中期息每股0.04港元，按年激增248%，派息比率維持在72.7%的高水平；截至期末，公司手頭淨現金達4.56億港元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">富瑞分析指，受惠於人民幣匯率走強刺激訪港內地旅客消費，配合管理層積極透過社交平台進行產品推廣，成功將內地客轉化率由5%倍增至10%。該行預期，由於去年12月比較基數偏低，集團第四季整體銷售將延續強勁增長步伐。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17225687-%e5%af%8c%e7%91%9e%e8%aa%bf%e9%ab%98%e8%8e%8e%e8%8e%8e%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e7%9b%ae%e6%a8%99%e5%83%b9%e8%87%b31-81%e5%85%83-%e7%b6%ad%e6%8c%81%e3%80%8c%e8%b2%b7%e5%85%a5%e3%80%8d%e8%a9%95%e7%b4%9a",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/06/20240619_FI_source-web_00178-1.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-20 17:21:10",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "全日收市｜港股午後曾挫500點 科網生科同捱沽  全周科指插近8%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股恒生指數全日跌430點，恒生科技指數跌近4%，網易(09999)捱沽，成跌市元兇，生科股幾全線挫，一周計恒指累跌1227點，科指跌近8%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"港股 AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">港股 AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數全日跌430點或1.89%，報22,410，開跌359點或1.57%，報22,482點，早段見22,593，跌248點或1.08%，已為全日高位，隨即拾級而下，低見22,307，瀉534點或2.33%，為全日低位。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數全日跌138點或3.78%，報3,511，今早開跌1107點或2.95%，報3,541，</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生國企指數全日跌1.77%或135點，報7,554 ; 今早開報7,568，跌122點或1.59%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交2,703億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">一周計，恒指累跌1,227點或5.19% ; 科指累跌302點或7.92% ; 國指跌383點或4.82%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指跌    點或1.61%，報22,440，低水12點 ; 科指期貨跌107點或2.94%，報3,538，高水3點 ; 國指期貨跌110或1.43%，報7,570，高水3點。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"藥明官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1140x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/08/20230823_FI_source-web_藥明生物.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"藥明官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1140x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/08/20230823_FI_source-web_藥明生物.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">藥明官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">生科股全線捱沽，，藥明生物(02269)收跌6.57%，報40.96元，已連跌4天 ;金斯瑞生物科技 (01548)跌7.96%，報27.76元 ; 藥明合聯(02268)跌5.61%，報59.7元 ; 康方生物 (09926)挫7.05%，報56.7元 ; 信達生物(01801)跌6.26%，報80.1元 ; 百濟神州 (06160)跌4.86%，報230.8(元 ; 翰森製藥(03692)跌5.18%，報30.74元。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">業績股是市場焦點之一，網易(09999)收跌17.6%，報154元，推低恒指86點，低見150.3元，為52周新低，為最大跌市元兇，上季經調整盈利跌3.6%；快手(01024)收瀉11.37%，報20.42元，上季經調整盈利跌84%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"網易 (Shutterstock圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230823_FI_source_licensed_09999-2_shutterstock_.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"網易 (Shutterstock圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230823_FI_source_licensed_09999-2_shutterstock_.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">網易 (Shutterstock圖片)</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)績後反彈，全日升3.48%，報83.35元，貢獻恒指51點，成唯一大市支撐。經調整EBITA增長260%至326.36億元人民幣 ; 收入按年增長10%至2,715.19億元人民幣，市場視為勝預期，管理層電話會議中指引樂觀。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">晶片股回調，華虹宏力(01347)收挫10.17%，報75.1元 ; 中芯國際(00981)跌2.73%，報49.12元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國際銀行股受壓，滙控(00005)收跌3.08%，報129.2元; 渣打(02888)大插4.7%，報203元。外電指歐洲央行考慮將商業銀行最低準備金要求由1%上調至2%，市場預期推高融資成本，影響銀行的流動資金管理及回報。友邦也跌2.38%，報73.75元。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17225330-%e5%85%a8%e6%97%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82%ef%bd%9c%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e5%8d%88%e5%be%8c%e6%9b%be%e6%8c%ab500%e9%bb%9e-%e7%a7%91%e7%b6%b2%e7%94%9f%e7%a7%91%e5%90%8c%e6%8d%b1%e6%b2%bd-%e5%85%a8%e5%91%a8",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK-5.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-20 16:53:16",
